{"symbol":"JAYKAILASH","yahoo":"JAYKAILASH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Jay Kailash Namkeen Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","website":"https://www.jaykailashnamkeen.com","about":"Jay Kailash Namkeen Limited operates in the snack food market in India. It offers a range of namkeen products, such as tikha mitha mix, bhavbagari and tikha gathiya, salted and garlic sev murmura, ratmali and besan sev, cracker munch fire masala, Punjabi crunchy sticks and pasta sticks; shali gulab revdi sweets; kaju and choco chips biscuits; pudina and chatpata chana, as well as masala chana and plain mung jor pulses. The company also provides moon chips, pasta, half moon, masala wheels, and face lock fryums; tikha farali chevda farali namkeen products; and wafer products. It offers its products under the Jay Kailash Namkeen brand name. The company was formerly known as Jay Kailash Namkeen (OPC) Private Limited and changed its name to Jay Kailash Namkeen Limited in May 2022. Jay Kailash Namkeen Limited was founded in 2013 and is based in Rajkot, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:32:22+00:00","quote":{"price":57.95,"prevClose":61.0,"marketCap":28.96,"high52":75.65,"low52":10.73,"pe":24.05,"bookValue":39.53,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":6.3,"shares":0.4997,"insiders":55.74,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-04-08","2024-04-09","2024-04-10","2024-04-12","2024-04-15","2024-04-16","2024-04-18","2024-04-19","2024-04-22","2024-04-23","2024-04-24","2024-04-25","2024-04-26","2024-04-29","2024-04-30","2024-05-02","2024-05-03","2024-05-06","2024-05-07","2024-05-08","2024-05-09","2024-05-10","2024-05-13","2024-05-14","2024-05-15","2024-05-16","2024-05-17","2024-05-21","2024-05-22","2024-05-23","2024-05-24","2024-05-27","2024-05-28","2024-05-29","2024-05-30","2024-05-31","2024-06-03","2024-06-04","2024-06-05","2024-06-06","2024-06-07","2024-06-10","2024-06-11","2024-06-12","2024-06-13","2024-06-14","2024-06-18","2024-06-19","2024-06-20","2024-06-21","2024-06